        <a href="mailto:hr@edurankai.in?subject=Open Application" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-burn text-white font-semibold text-[0.9rem] px-6 py-3 rounded-xl no-underline transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-burn/90">hr@edurankai.in</a>
